", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "voice_instruct"}, {"widget": {"name": "steps"}, "name": "steps", "label": "steps", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "steps"}, {"widget": {"name": "speed"}, "name": "speed", "label": "speed", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "speed"}, {"widget": {"name": "duration"}, "name": "duration", "label": "duration", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "duration"}, {"widget": {"name": "device"}, "name": "device", "label": "device", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "device"}, {"widget": {"name": "dtype"}, "name": "dtype", "label": "dtype", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "dtype"}, {"widget": {"name": "attention"}, "name": "attention", "label": "attention", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "attention"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}], "flags": {}, "id": 52, "type": "OmniVoiceVoiceDesignTTS", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "OmniVoiceVoiceDesignTTS"}, "order": 29}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#c09430", "widgets_values": ["# OmniVoice TTS\n\n  ## 自动下载\n\n  **模型会在首次运行时自动下载**，无需手动设置！\n\n  | 模型 | 显存需求 | 大小 |\n  |-------|------|------|\n  | OmniVoice（fp32） | 约 8-12GB | 约 4GB |\n  | OmniVoice-bf16 | 约 4-6GB | 约 2GB |\n\n  ---\n\n  ## 手动下载\n\n  | 文件 | 大小 | 链接 |\n  |------|------|------|\n  | OmniVoice（完整 fp32） | 约 4GB | [下载](https://huggingface.co/k2-fsa/OmniVoice) |\n  | OmniVoice-bf16 | 约 2GB | [下载](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/OmniVoice-bf16) |\n\n\n```\n  📂 ComfyUI/\n  ├── 📂 models/\n  │   ├── 📂 omnivoice/\n  │   │      ├── 📂 OmniVoice/\n  │   │      │      ├── config.json\n  │   │      │      └── model.safetensors\n  │   │      └── 📂 OmniVoice-bf16/\n  │   │             ├── config.json\n  │   │             └── model.safetensors\n  │   └── 📂 audio_encoders/\n  │          ├── 📂 openai_whisper-large-v3-turbo/\n  │          │      ├── config.json\n  │          │      └── model.safetensors\n  │          └── 📂 openai_whisper-medium/\n  │                 ├── config.json\n  │                 └── model.safetensors\n```\n\n  ---\n\n  ## 节点\n\n  ### OmniVoice Longform TTS\n  长文本 TTS，带智能分段，并可选支持声音克隆。`ref_audio` 为可选项，不连接时会自动使用默认声音。\n\n  ### OmniVoice Voice Clone TTS\n  通过参考音频克隆声音。`ref_audio` 为必填。此节点不做分段处理，长文本请使用 Longform TTS。\n\n  ### OmniVoice Voice Design TTS\n  根据文本描述设计合成声音。无需参考音频。\n\n  ### OmniVoice Multi-Speaker TTS\n  使用 `[Speaker_N]:` 标签生成多说话人对话。在 ComfyUI >= 0.8.1 中支持动态说话人输入。\n\n  ### OmniVoice Whisper Loader\n  预加载 Whisper ASR，避免每次运行时重复下载。可连接到任意 TTS 节点的 `whisper_model` 输入端。\n\n  ---\n\n  ## 生成参数\n\n  | 参数 | 默认值 | 范围 | 说明 |\n  |-----------|---------|-------|-------------|\n  | steps | 32 | 4-64 | 扩散步数。16=更快，32=平衡，64=最佳质量 |\n  | guidance_scale | 2.0 | 0-10 | 无分类器引导强度。越高 = 越贴合文本 |\n  | t_shift | 0.1 | 0-1 | 时间步偏移。越小 = 越强调前期步骤 |\n  | speed | 1.0 | 0.5-2.0 | 语速。>1=更快，<1=更慢 |\n  | duration | 0.0 | 0-60 | 固定输出时长（秒）。会覆盖 speed。0=自动 |\n  | position_temperature | 5.0 | 0-20 | 掩码位置随机性。0=贪心，越高=越随机 |\n  | class_temperature | 0.0 | 0-5 | Token 采样随机性。0=贪心，越高=越随机 |\n  | layer_penalty_factor | 5.0 | 0-20 | 对更深层 codebook 的惩罚系数 |\n  | denoise | True | — | 在前面添加去噪 token，以获得更干净的输出 |\n  | preprocess_prompt | True | — | 清理参考音频（移除静音、补充标点） |\n  | postprocess_output | True | — | 移除生成音频中的长静音 |\n  | keep_model_loaded | True | — | 将模型保留在内存中（两次运行之间会卸载到 CPU） |\n\n  **仅 Longform TTS：**\n\n  | 参数 | 默认值 | 范围 | 说明 |\n  |-----------|---------|-------|-------------|\n  | words_per_chunk | 100 | 0-500 | 每段词数。0=不分段。会按句子边界切分 |\n\n  ---\n\n  ## Whisper ASR 模型（用于自动转写）\n\n  | 模型 | 显存需求 | 链接 |\n  |-------|------|------|\n  | whisper-large-v3-turbo | 约 1.5GB | [下载](https://huggingface.co/openai/whisper-large-v3-turbo) |\n  | whisper-large-v3 | 约 3GB | [下载](https://huggingface.co/openai/whisper-large-v3) |\n  | whisper-medium | 约 1.5GB | [下载](https://huggingface.co/openai/whisper-medium) |\n  | whisper-small | 约 0.5GB | [下载](https://huggingface.co/openai/whisper-small) |\n  | whisper-tiny | 约 0.4GB | [下载](https://huggingface.co/openai/whisper-tiny) |\n\n  ---\n\n  ## 非语言表达标签：\n\n  `[laughter]` `[sigh]` `[sniff]` `[question-en]` `[question-ah]` `[question-oh]` `[question-ei]` `[question-yi]` `[surprise-ah]` `[surprise-oh]` `[surprise-wa]` `[surprise-yo]` `[dissatisfaction-hnn]` `[confirmation-en]`\n\n  ---\n\n  ## 声音设计属性（用逗号分隔）：\n\n  | 类别 | 可选项 |\n  |----------|---------|\n  | 性别 | `male`, `female` |\n  | 年龄 | `child`, `young`, `middle-aged`, `elderly` |\n  | 音高 | `very low pitch`, `low pitch`, `medium pitch`, `high pitch`, `very high pitch` |\n  | 风格 | `whisper` |\n  | 英语口音 | `american accent`, `british accent`, `australian accent`, `canadian accent`, `indian accent`, `irish accent`, `scottish accent`, `south african accent` |\n  | 中文方言 | `四川话`, `陕西话`, `广东话`, `东北话`, `山东话`, `河南话`, `上海话`, `闽南话`, `客家话` |\n\n  **示例：** `female, young, high pitch, british accent, whisper`\n\n  ---\n\n  ## 多说话人对话格式：\n  [Speaker_1]: Hello, I'm speaker one.\n  [Speaker_2]: And I'm speaker two!\n  [Speaker_1]: Nice to meet you!\n\n  ---\n\n  ## 链接\n\n  - 原始模型 [OmniVoice](https://huggingface.co/k2-fsa/OmniVoice)\n  - 模型 [OmniVoice](https://huggingface.co/k2-fsa/OmniVoice) / [OmniVoice-bf16](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/OmniVoice-bf16)\n  - 论文 [arXiv:2604.00688](https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.00688)\n  - 问题反馈 [Report Bug](https://github.com/saganaki22/ComfyUI-OmniVoice-TTS/issues)\n"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "-", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "rgba(24,24,27,.9)", "size": [525.7818603515625, 933.3532104492188], "pos": [2750.0595703125, 213.8140411376953], "id": 37, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 18}, {"outputs": [{"widget": {"name": "voice_instruct"}, "name": "STRING", "links": [40], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": ["女，老年"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveNode", "mode": 0, 