，第二声\nSHE2 表示读 she，第二声\nZHE1 表示读 zhe，第一声\n所以它不是正常写法，而是“给模型看的发音提示”。\n\n英文\n可以用 CMU 发音词典的音标格式，而且要：\n\n放在方括号里\n用大写\n用空格分开音素\n例如：\n[IH1 T]\n这是在强制某个英文片段按指定音素发音。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [369.3077087402344, 373.49322509765625], "pos": [4438.89208984375, 428.16265869140625], "id": 57, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 26}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [-4053.876245882294, -123.91483089899492], "scale": 1.412292769524485}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "声音克隆", "bounding": [3296.073486328125, 178.45803833007812, 780.1353759765625, 1267.8270263671875]}, {"color": "#88A", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "长文本语音克隆", "bounding": [4092.965087890625, 177.56973266601562, 786.9231567382812, 1268.9991455078125]}, {"color": "#8A8", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 3, "title": "声音设计", "bounding": [4895.5234375, 179.9728240966797, 620.2483520507812, 1268.6292724609375]}, {"color": "#8AA", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 4, "title": "Multi-Speaker", "bounding": [5536.55078125, 180.41183471679688, 904.1465454101562, 1273.701904296875]}], "links": [[1, 7, 0, 1, 0, "*"], [2, 5, 0, 2, 0, "AUDIO"], [3, 4, 0, 5, 0, "AUDIO"], [4, 6, 0, 5, 3, "STRING"], [5, 7, 0, 5, 4, "STRING"], [6, 3, 0, 7, 0, "QWEN3ASR_MODEL"], [7, 4, 0, 7, 1, "AUDIO"], [35, 30, 0, 51, 10, "AUDIO"], [36, 31, 0, 51, 12, "AUDIO"], [37, 50, 0, 51, 1, "STRING"], [38, 51, 0, 49, 0, "AUDIO"], [39, 47, 0, 52, 1, "STRING"], [40, 48, 0, 52, 2, "STRING"], [41, 52, 0, 46, 0, "AUDIO"], [42, 24, 0, 53, 0, "AUDIO"], [43, 45, 0, 53, 3, "STRING"], [45, 53, 0, 44, 0, "AUDIO"], [46, 54, 0, 53, 1, "WHISPER_ASR"], [47, 23, 0, 55, 0, "AUDIO"], [49, 43, 0, 55, 3, "STRING"], [50, 55, 0, 42, 0, "AUDIO"], [52, 56, 0, 55, 1, "WHISPER_ASR"]], "id": "1fdf336a-4f4e-41e9-91c2-814ab5291e27", "config": {}, "version": 0.4, "last_node_id": 57, 